#: src/ai/privacy-and-security.md:3
msgid "Privacy and Security"
msgstr ""

#: src/ai/privacy-and-security.md:5
msgid "Philosophy"
msgstr "理念"

#: src/ai/privacy-and-security.md:7
msgid ""
"Zed collects minimal data necessary to serve and improve our product. "
"Features that could share data, like AI and telemetry, are either opt-in or "
"can be disabled."
msgstr ""

#: src/ai/privacy-and-security.md:9
msgid ""
"**Telemetry**: Zed collects only the data necessary to understand usage and "
"fix issues. Client-side telemetry can be disabled in settings."
msgstr ""

#: src/ai/privacy-and-security.md:11
msgid ""
"**AI**: Data sharing for AI improvement is opt-in, and each share is a one-"
"time action; it does not grant permission for future data collection. You "
"can use Zed's AI features without sharing any data with Zed and without "
"authenticating."
msgstr ""

#: src/ai/privacy-and-security.md:13
msgid ""
"**Open-Source**: Zed's codebase is public. You can inspect exactly what data "
"is collected and how it's handled. If you find issues, we encourage you to "
"report them."
msgstr ""

#: src/ai/privacy-and-security.md:15
msgid ""
"**Secure-by-default**: Designing Zed and our Service with \"secure-by-"
"default\" as an objective is of utmost importance to us. We take your "
"security and ours very seriously and strive to follow industry best-practice "
"in order to uphold that principle."
msgstr ""

